{"reviewId": "442867119_8bxTw4zI9", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "增长与通胀的关系，就像\"城市来了很多年轻人\"。\n第一步：增长\n年轻人涌入城市，找工作、开公司、消费——经济火了，这是增长。\n第二步：通胀\n但城市的房子、水电、牛肉面馆就那么多。人多了，大家抢，房租涨、物价涨——这是通胀。\n第三步：反制\n涨到一定程度，年轻人发现：工资涨得没有房租快，开店利润被成本吃掉，待不下去了。于是有人离开，有人关店——增长自己熄火了。\n这就是\"价格对增长的反制\"：\n增长不是想快就能快的，它要消耗资源；资源有限，抢的人多了就涨价；涨价本身就是增长的刹车片。\n", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "4132-4191", "abstract": "我们对康波表象的基本认识，实际上就是康波中增长与通胀的关系。任何周期的机制都可以理解为价格对增长的反制，康波也不例外。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "442867119_8bxTw4zI9", "userVid": 442867119, "topics": [], "createTime": 1787383874, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 442867119, "name": "爱发呆的余哲", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0023-OZYGhxoCO16FYHoQ2m1bE10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "爱发呆的余哲", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 107, "likes": [{"userVid": 387216999, "name": "虚静", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/97z5zNzGZyQo2H14PTibQOxlhBJw5JIdAOs8kWZXLavIgK9kt6fBlH7KWMPoW9xuVPdpmVmicErVtkULNFPOvZeA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "虚静", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-500", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 500}}], "commentsCount": 3,